    <title>第二届噪点音乐节到底请了“谁”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64a83415f4ccb12e0b531f80</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64a83415f4ccb12e0b531f80</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 07 Jul 2023 15:49:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>💥</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于第二届噪点音乐节到底请了“谁”，这恐怕是个难以一语说清的问题。</span></p><span></span><p><span>正如我们在发布全阵容时解读的那样，今年噪点邀请的艺术家，除了拥有极具张力的个人作品之外，背后也与许多乐队有着千丝万缕的联系。如果要将所有人的关系画出来，可能会连成一张巨大的谱系图，其中涉及到的必定是国内独立音乐领域最具代表性的经典作品。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期声厂电台特别节目，就带诸位游历与这些艺术家及乐队相关的各色作品。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk4gqq3X-YqVQBF1hhATh9y0Ooy1.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><br></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 李铁桥</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>李铁桥</span></strong><span> - 山海关</span><br><span> </span><strong><span>美好药店</span></strong><span> - 马龙</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><br></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="509">08:29</a> 李星</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>红领巾</span></strong><span> - 畸形秀</span><br><span> </span><strong><span>乌飞兔走昼还夜</span></strong><span> - 黑与白</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><br></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1738">28:58</a> 刘㔻</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>刘㔻/张安定</span></strong><span> - A05席间生斜刺</span><br><span> </span><strong><span>发梦茱莉</span></strong><span> - 你想要的样子我都没有</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><br></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2256">37:36</a> 梅志勇</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>发光曲线 </span></strong><span>ft.</span><strong><span> 梅志勇</span></strong><span> - 起源：残响</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><br></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2509">41:49</a> 张荐</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>不一定 </span></strong><span>-</span><strong><span> </span></strong><span>佐罗在中国01</span><strong><br><span>FM3</span></strong><span> - Yi Gui</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><br></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3236">53:56</a> 周凤岭</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>周凤岭</span></strong><span> - 玻璃房</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><br></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3547">59:07</a> black midi</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span>John L</span><br><span>27 Questions</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><br></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4150">69:10</a> 李增辉</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>疯医</span></strong><span> - 回声之丘</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><br></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4581">76:21</a> 宋雨喆</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>宋雨喆</span></strong><span> - 我承诺不要太悲情</span><strong><br><span>木推瓜</span></strong><span> - 彼岸束棒舞Finale</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><br></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5165">86:05</a> 张梦</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>张梦</span></strong><span> - 孟夏夜之喠</span><strong><br><span>五条人</span></strong><span> - 活鱼逆流而上，死鱼随波逐流</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><br></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5541">92:21</a> Daoud Akira</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>Daoud Akira</span></strong><span> ft. </span><strong><span>Chikaco</span></strong><span> - Belle Epoque</span><strong><br><span>幾何学模様</span></strong><span> - Dripping Sun</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><br></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6221">103:41</a> 文智涌</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>文智涌</span></strong><span> - 八十年代</span><strong><br><span>朝简</span></strong><span> - 下雨了</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><br></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6860">114:20</a> 杨海崧</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>杨海崧</span></strong><span>/</span><strong><span>谢玉岗</span></strong><span> - 布拉吉第六部分</span><strong><br><span>P.K.14</span></strong><span> - 有些意外发生地太早</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><br></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7488">124:48</a> 舌头</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span>小鸡出壳</span><br><span>妈妈一起飞吧，妈妈一起摇滚吧</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><br></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8240">137:20</a> 田鹏</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>田鹏</span></strong><span>/</span><strong><span>虎子</span></strong><span> - Island</span><strong><br><span>超级市场</span></strong><span> - 肥蝶他久久不能离去</span></blockquote><span></span><h2><span>#来到现场</span></h2><span></span><p><span>🔍 秀动搜索 噪点音乐节 / black midi 获取以下演出票务信息</span></p><span></span><p><span>08/02 black midi 中国巡演上海站（已售罄）</span></p><span></span><p><span>08/03 black midi 中国巡演广州站</span></p><span></span><p><span>08/05-06 西安·第二届噪点音乐节</span></p><span></span><h2><span>#加入我们</span></h2><span></span><p><span>🙋 全职/实习岗位开放投递中</span></p><span></span><p><span>💬 入听友群请加微信：soundfactxian</span></p><span></span><p><span>🙌 关注声厂SoundFact公众号获取新鲜资讯</span></p>]]></description>
