    <guid isPermaLink="false">639979bd3a2b7eba5ceb466d</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 24 Dec 2022 04:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🌊</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果用唱片概念来类比的话，这是一次</span><strong><span>“重发行”（reissue）</span></strong><span>。它出自今年4月30日-5月1日，在噪点音乐节本该发生的日子里，我们呈现的声厂电台特别策划——</span><strong><span>声厂20小时：音乐人的孤岛歌单。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>彼时，在众多失落的城市与凝固的空气中，我们共同聆听了整整20小时的音乐。周身的气息也变得温和，落日并不遥远，夜晚写满感动。以至于时至今日，总还能记起当时的风和心情，</span><strong><span>它值得被补上一份留档。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>本次reissue版本在原直播基础上进行精简再编，打破原先的时间顺序，依据听感上的连接重新组合，共分为6期节目，每期约100分钟，在接下来的三个周末逐一上线，敬请收听。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgtj3JkkPG9VgwwVyGWh7i-Ukofb.JPG"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><br></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1">00:00:01</a> 张佺</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>Värttinä - Tumala</span><br><span>Faun - Arcadia</span><br><span>Bert Jansch &amp; John Renbourn - Hole In The Coal</span><br><span>Ariwo - To Earth</span><br><span>José González - How Low</span><br><span>Boubacar Traoré - Kanou</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><br></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2354">00:39:14</a> 李铁桥</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>Ned Rothenberg &amp; Samir Chatterjee &amp; Jerome Harris - March Hair</span><br><span>Ned Rothenberg &amp; Samir Chatterjee &amp; Jerome Harris - One-Oh-Nine</span><br><span>Ned Rothenberg &amp; Samir Chatterjee &amp; Jerome Harris - Miss Chief</span><br><span>Ned Rothenberg - The Foot In It</span><br><span>404.zero - Black Sunday</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><br></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4164">01:09:24</a> 法兰克福头盔</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>Brandt Brauer Frick - Mi Corazon</span><br><span>Lanark Artefax - Glasz</span><br><span>Floating Points &amp; Pharoah Sanders &amp; The London Symphony Orchestra - Movement 7</span><br><span>Radian - Pickup Pickout</span><br><span>Ludwig Göransson - Freeport</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>入听友群请加微信：soundfactxian</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>关注声厂SoundFact公众号了解我们</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
